      "supporting_address_locator": "HTML lines 2043-2047; paragraph beginning The existing fast chargers: NRMA at Cross-Street Carpark",
      "reason": "Individually reviewed cross-document site identity: the 2024 council business-case PDF (actual pages 128, 255, 318) links 8-24 Cross Street and 8 Cross Street to Lot 3 DP828377, its carpark use, and the Tarcutta/Cross Street site map. The complete 2022 council agenda HTML identifies an existing NRMA charger at Cross-Street Carpark. Together these archived originals support interpreting this record's 8/24 as the site address range; the raw source address remains unchanged and no generic slash/unit-number equivalence is introduced. Named operator-published KML and same-operator OSM agree within 10.92 m. The PDF alone does not name NRMA or provide charger-bay coordinates; site identity is a reviewer inference across the two originals. The web-extracted 2026 property register is a research lead only, not production evidence. Historical site and map evidence does not establish present charging availability."
