      "reason": "NRMA's archived operator article describes its first Wollongong site as installed and operating on Stewart Street. The NSW government gateway report (actual PDF page 5) documents and maps Stewart Street East / Bank Street carpark. The pinned OCM record independently labels the NRMA Stewart Street Carpark at 17 Stewart Street, matching the source's street and postcode, and its point agrees with the named operator-published KML within 8.40 m. Use that archived OCM point with verified operator-reference data; do not fabricate an OSM match. This is a reviewed inference across operator text, named maps and a government venue map, not a survey or a claim of live availability. The 2026 planning report supports the site's cadastral identity, not the December 2025 charging state. Earlier council PDF URLs that returned 403 are research leads only and are not production evidence. All original coordinates, postal fields, address, equipment and source status are retained."
